    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The first metro stations in Olivais, Olivais and Cabo Ruivo, opened in 1998, marking the area’s entry into Lisbon’s underground network.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
